        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Safety officers considered a strict material budget while preparing a capacity check for the transport museum exhibit. The exhibit compares historic and modern transport shapes. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A closed cone has radius 5 cm and perpendicular height 12 cm. Find its total surface area in cm², correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 3,
      "primary_outcome": "5.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "rounded_dp",
        "canonical_answer": "282.7",
        "canonical_latex": "282.7",
        "accepted_answers": [],
        "absolute_tolerance": null,
        "rounding_precision": 1,
        "unit": null
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "stage": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Find the slant height before calculating the curved area."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "latex": "l=\\sqrt{5^{2}+12^{2}}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", then add "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "latex": "\\pi rl"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "inline_math",
              "latex": "\\pi r^{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Select the relevant dimensions and apply the mensuration relationship."
            },
            {
              "type": "display_math",
              "latex": "l=\\sqrt{5^2+12^2}=13,\\quad S=\\pi(5)(13)+\\pi(5)^2=282.7"
            }
